{"component_id_namespace":"ec077a53-0b40-5f21-b1fe-a62094d2476b","component_schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","components":[{"attributes":{"code":"TMC","legacy_node_id":"ks-topeka:tmc:2.205.060","page_type":"section"},"citation":"2.205.060","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/2.205.060","content_hash":"adf04472227a80d05b15b49bc7f91fb4f61f3cf76c9ce617762389d22d4f5734","heading":"Topeka Metropolitan Transit Authority.","ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":null,"schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.205.060:section","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/2.205.060","text":"(a) Cited. The City of Topeka adopted the Metropolitan Transit Authority Act, K.S.A. 12-2801 et seq. and amendments thereto (“the Act”) and by charter ordinance has made certain provisions of the Act inapplicable to the City and provided certain substitute provisions therefor.\n(b) Membership. The terms and conditions of membership of the Board shall be governed by Appx. A , Section A9-1 et seq. (Ord. 20206 § 75, 9-10-19; Ord. 19413 § 1, 5-4-10. Code 1995 § 2-224. Formerly 2.05.060.)\nCross References: Buses, Chapter 10.40 TMC.\nThe following sections refer to Topeka Metropolitan Transit Authority responsibilities: Bus stop benches, TMC 10.40.130 .","type":"section","workbench_component_id":"4a8c6255-6a42-5e53-aa0b-d37c2791236b"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"2.205.060","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/2.205.060","content_hash":"46f7cc60a0aa7cb24ea6ffcab3f69a9f3dd83a0a52cf1975ad9f3d5d94dafa21","heading":null,"ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.205.060:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.205.060:block:0","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/2.205.060","text":"(a) Cited. The City of Topeka adopted the Metropolitan Transit Authority Act, K.S.A